{"id":"en_daddy-s-little-secret","title":"Daddy's Little Secret","titleEn":"Daddy's Little Secret","description":"Chloe agreed to act as a surrogate for Alexander, a powerful underworld figure, in a desperate attempt to save her dying father. After the child was born, she was compelled to disappear. She later comes back under a changed appearance and a new identity, taking a job as a housekeeper so she can remain near her daughter. Alexander grows suspicious that she is hiding something and begins testing her, while the child forms an instinctive bond with her, gradually drawing Chloe toward embracing her role as a mother.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/daddys-little-secret/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/daddys-little-secret/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Love After Divorce","Multiple Identities","Revenge","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvt46/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_daddy-s-little-secret_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvt46/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_daddy-s-little-secret_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvt46/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_daddy-s-little-secret_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvt46/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_daddy-s-little-secret_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvt46/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloa